<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>灵签智解 | Wong Tai Sin Fortune Assistant</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="./style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Wong Tai Sin Fortune RAG Assistant</p>
        <h1>灵签智解</h1>
        <p class="subtitle">
          基于黄大仙灵签 100 签、Chroma 检索与 Qwen3-4B 的智能求签解签系统。
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="seal">签</div>
        <p>传统文化文本解释 · 娱乐参考 · 自我反思</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="layout">
      <section class="panel">
        <h2>开始求签</h2>

        <label class="field">
          <span>后端 API 地址</span>
          <input id="apiBase" type="text" placeholder="例如：http://192.168.85.136:8080；留空则使用当前地址" />
        </label>

        <label class="field">
          <span>你的问题</span>
          <textarea id="question" rows="4" placeholder="例如：我最近找实习会不会顺利？"></textarea>
        </label>

        <div class="grid-2">
          <label class="field">
            <span>问题方向</span>
            <select id="aspect">
              <option value="">自动识别</option>
              <option value="career">事业 / 求职</option>
              <option value="study">学业 / 考试</option>
              <option value="love">感情 / 姻缘</option>
              <option value="wealth">财富 / 投资</option>
              <option value="health">健康</option>
              <option value="family">家庭</option>
              <option value="general">综合</option>
            </select>
          </label>

          <label class="field">
            <span>签号模式</span>
            <select id="drawMode">
              <option value="random">随机抽签</option>
              <option value="fixed">指定签号</option>
            </select>
          </label>
        </div>

        <label class="field" id="signIdField">
          <span>指定签号 1-100</span>
          <input id="signId" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="23" />
        </label>

        <button id="submitBtn" class="primary-btn">开始求签解签</button>

        <p class="notice">
          本系统仅用于传统文化文本解释、娱乐参考和自我反思，不构成现实决策建议。
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="panel result-panel">
        <div class="result-header">
          <div>
            <h2>解签结果</h2>
            <p id="meta" class="meta">等待求签...</p>
          </div>
          <button id="clearBtn" class="ghost-btn">清空</button>
        </div>

        <div id="loading" class="loading hidden">
          <div class="spinner"></div>
          <span>正在抽签、检索签文并生成解签...</span>
        </div>

        <div id="signCard" class="sign-card hidden">
          <div class="sign-card-main">
            <span id="signNumber" class="sign-number">第 --- 签</span>
            <strong id="signLevel" class="sign-level">---</strong>
          </div>
          <div class="sign-card-sub">
            <span id="storyTitle">典故：---</span>
            <span id="aspectLabel">方向：---</span>
          </div>
          <div id="chunkTypeBadges" class="badges"></div>
        </div>

        
        <div class="sign-map-section">
          <div class="sign-map-header">
            <div>
              <h3>100 签签盘</h3>
              <p class="notice">每个格子代表一支签，颜色表示吉凶等级；抽中的签会自动高亮。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sign-map-legend">
              <span><i class="legend-dot level-best"></i>上上</span>
              <span><i class="legend-dot level-good"></i>上吉</span>
              <span><i class="legend-dot level-midgood"></i>中吉</span>
              <span><i class="legend-dot level-neutral"></i>中平</span>
              <span><i class="legend-dot level-bad"></i>下下</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div id="signMap" class="sign-map">
            <p class="muted">正在加载 100 签签盘...</p>
          </div>
        </div>


        <article id="answer" class="answer empty">
          请在左侧输入问题，然后点击“开始求签解签”。
        </article>

        <div class="evidence-section">
          <h3>RAG 检索依据分数</h3>
          <div id="scoreBars" class="score-bars"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="evidence-section">
          <h3>签文依据 Evidence</h3>
          <div id="evidenceList" class="evidence-list"></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <section class="panel dashboard-panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">Data Science Dashboard</p>
      <h2>数据可视化与检索评估</h2>
      <p class="notice">
        该区域展示 100 签数据集结构、RAG 检索效果和模型评估结果，可直接截图放入报告。
      </p>

      <div class="metrics-grid">
        <div class="metric-card">
          <span>Hit@1</span>
          <strong id="hit1Metric">待生成</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <span>Hit@3</span>
          <strong id="hit3Metric">待生成</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="metric-card">
          <span>MRR</span>
          <strong id="mrrMetric">待生成</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="notice dashboard-note">
        数据集分布图和检索评估图已保留在 <code>outputs/figures/</code>，用于报告展示；
        前端主界面仅展示动态求签结果、RAG 检索分数和核心评估指标。
      </p>
</section>
  </div>

  <script src="./app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>